{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 23, :comments ["<b>And the chief cupbearer did not remember Joseph.</b> He did not mention him by mouth to Pharaoh immediately upon his release, as Joseph had asked of him — כי אם זכרתני אתך — and therefore <b>and he forgot him</b> — in his heart. End of the pericah of וישב."], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 40, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:08:07.706245895Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}